ass=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Lighthouse (Jer's Junkyard before the map remake)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,400</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Can be used to move multiple items around the property, cant be grab by Grabby Grabber and Grabbiest Grabber</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.28.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Trolley</b> is an object that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Jerry%27s_Junk\" title=\"Jerry&#39;s Junk\">Jerry's Junk</a> for $1400. It allows players to move a small amount of cargo.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Trolley is effectively a human-powered version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Flatbed_Trailer\" title=\"Basic Flatbed Trailer\">Basic Flatbed Trailer</a>. Objects can be placed on top of the Trolley, and they will attach to it, allowing the player to move multiple objects at once. If it tips over, it will immediately dump all of its cargo onto the ground.\n</p><p>The Trolley cannot be grabbed by any <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Grabbers\" title=\"Category:Grabbers\">grabbers</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to the map revamp, the Trolley was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a>.</li>\n<li>The original price of the Trolley was $280 until it was removed. The developers said: \"Trolley will return to the Junkyard soon! Removed it temporarily until it fully works properly.\" Trolleys returned in update 1.28.0 for a price of $680, although this price was soon changed to $1,400 in update 1.28.1.</li>\n<li>We're still not sure if it explodes.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902142425\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019397/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n